    <string name="privacy_policy_body">Simple Khata stores your customer names, optional phone numbers, and transaction entries privately in Google Firebase Cloud Firestore scoped strictly to your authenticated Google User ID.\n\nNo customer accounts, advertising trackers, or third-party data sharing are used. Offline caching keeps a local encrypted-by-OS copy on your device so the app works without internet and syncs when reconnected.</string>
